      "content": "it doesn't feel like \"weather\" though. it feels permanent. like i'm just stuck in this middle place where i'm not really living, but i'm not with him either. he was my anchor. without him, i'm just drifting. i keep thinking about how peaceful it would be to just go to him. to finally not have to fight this heaviness anymore. it feels like the only way to actually be at peace again.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
